  "id": "c1c207be-85db-560b-a31f-23b037cd8a8e",
  "slug": "bikini-sandwiches-recipe-11958328",
  "name": "Bikini Sandwiches",
  "recipe_type": "main",
  "brief_description": "Bikini sandwiches consist of buttered toasted bread topped with Manchego cheese and serrano ham. Each bite is warm, buttery, and layered with subtle tang and umami.",
  "cuisine": "American",
  "instructions": [
    {
      "position": 1,
      "text": "Top 2 bread slices evenly with serrano ham, followed by a sprinkle of 1/2 cup Manchego on each. Place remaining 2 bread slices on top of Manchego. Spread butter evenly on both sides of sandwiches."
    },
    {
      "position": 2,
      "text": "Heat a large nonstick skillet over medium. Add sandwiches to skillet; lightly cover with aluminum foil, then place a large cast-iron skillet on top to compress. (Alternatively, use a heavy skillet weighted with 2 heavy cans.) Cook, flipping sandwiches once and adjusting heat as necessary, until bread is golden brown and toasted and cheese melts, 2 to 3 minutes per side."
    },
    {
      "position": 3,
      "text": "Transfer sandwiches to a cutting board. Cut the crusts off, then cut into triangles. Serve immediately. Recipe developed by Jasmine Smith"
    }
  ],
  "servings": 2,
  "cooking_time_minutes": 10,
  "preparation_time_minutes": 10,
